---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="API Documentation - PureScan AI" description="PureScan AI API documentation, machine-readable specifications, and agent discovery endpoints.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 mb-4">
        PureScan AI Developer & Agent Documentation
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">API & Agent Documentation</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">
        PureScan AI provides automated endpoints, OpenAPI schemas, and Agentic protocols for discovering and interacting with our food and cosmetic safety tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <!-- Overview Card -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Discovery Endpoints</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
          Machine-readable catalogs and specifications adhere to standard RFCs and draft protocols:
        </p>
        <ul class="divide-y divide-slate-100 font-mono text-sm">
          <li class="py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">RFC 9727 API Catalog:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500 block sm:inline sm:ml-2">/.well-known/api-catalog</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/.well-known/api-catalog" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline text-xs">View linkset+json</a>
          </li>
          <li class="py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">OpenAPI 3.0 Spec:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500 block sm:inline sm:ml-2">/api/openapi.json</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/api/openapi.json" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline text-xs">View OpenAPI JSON</a>
          </li>
          <li class="py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">ARD Capability Manifest:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500 block sm:inline sm:ml-2">/.well-known/ai-catalog.json</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/.well-known/ai-catalog.json" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline text-xs">View ai-catalog.json</a>
          </li>
          <li class="py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">MCP Server Card:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500 block sm:inline sm:ml-2">/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline text-xs">View MCP Card</a>
          </li>
          <li class="py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Agent Skills Index:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500 block sm:inline sm:ml-2">/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline text-xs">View Skills Index</a>
          </li>
          <li class="py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Auth & Registration:</span>
              <span class="text-slate-500 block sm:inline sm:ml-2">/auth.md</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/auth.md" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline text-xs">View auth.md</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Endpoints Details -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">REST & Utility Endpoints</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">GET</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">/api/health</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Returns service status, uptime, and version information.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold bg-green-100 text-green-800">POST</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">/api/checkout</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Creates a Dodo Payments checkout session for subscription plans.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold bg-green-100 text-green-800">POST</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">/api/portal</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Generates a self-service Dodo Payments customer billing portal session URL for verified customers.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold bg-green-100 text-green-800">POST</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">/api/webhook</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Receives verified Dodo Payments webhook lifecycle events and synchronizes Pro status.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">GET</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">/api/download</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Smart routing redirect to App Store (iOS) or Google Play Store (Android) based on user agent.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
